
{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1b2c3d4e5f67890",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 前端知识体系\n完整前端技术栈图谱",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2c3d4e5f6a7b891",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HTML / CSS\n- HTML5 语义化\n- 标签与可访问性 (a11y)\n- CSS 选择器、优先级\n- 盒模型、BFC\n- Flex / Grid 布局\n- 响应式设计\n- Tailwind / CSS Modules\n- CSS-in-JS / SCSS\n- 动画与过渡效果\n- 移动端适配 (rem/vw)",
      "x": -800,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d4e5f6a7b8c902",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## JavaScript\n- 基础语法、数据类型\n- 执行上下文、作用域链\n- 闭包、原型链\n- this 指向、深浅拷贝\n- 异步编程：Callback/Promise/async\n- 事件循环、微宏任务\n- DOM 操作、事件委托\n- 防抖、节流\n- 设计模式\n- ES6+ 新特性",
      "x": -520,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "d4e5f6a7b8c9d013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## TypeScript\n- 基础类型、联合交叉\n- 接口 vs 类型别名\n- 泛型、泛型约束\n- 高级类型\n- 类型体操\n- 声明文件\n- 工程化应用",
      "x": -520,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5f6a7b8c9d0e124",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## React\n- JSX 与 Fiber 架构\n- Hooks (useState/useEffect)\n- 自定义 Hooks\n- 组件通信\n- React Router\n- 状态管理：Redux/Zustand/Jotai\n- Next.js App Router\n- SSR / SSG / ISR\n- 性能优化：memo/useMemo",
      "x": 300,
      "y": -400,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6a7b8c9d0e1f235",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Vue\n- Vue3 组合式 API\n- 响应式原理\n- 组件与插槽\n- Vue Router\n- 状态管理：Pinia\n- Nuxt.js\n- 自定义指令\n- 组合式函数\n- 性能优化",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7b8c9d0e1f2a346",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 其他框架\n- Svelte\n- SolidJS\n- Astro\n- 微前端\n- qiankun",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8c9d0e1f2a3b457",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 构建工具\n- Vite\n- Webpack\n- Rollup\n- ESBuild\n- Turbopack\n- 模块化开发",
      "x": 580,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9d0e1f2a3b4c568",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Node.js\n- CommonJS / ESM\n- Buffer / Stream\n- Express / Koa\n- NestJS\n- 中间件\n- 文件操作",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0e1f2a3b4c5d679",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 工程化\n- Git 工作流\n- ESLint / Prettier\n- Husky / lint-staged\n- CI/CD\n- Docker\n- Linux 基础\n- Monorepo\n- pnpm / Nx / Turborepo",
      "x": 580,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "e1f2a3b4c5d6e78a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 浏览器原理\n- 渲染进程、主线程\n- V8 垃圾回收\n- 重绘重排\n- 缓存机制\n- 跨域与 CORS",
      "x": -300,
      "y": -450,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f2a3b4c5d6e7f89b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 网络协议\n- HTTP / HTTPS\n- HTTP 1.1 / 2 / 3\n- TCP 三次握手\n- DNS 解析\n- CDN 原理",
      "x": -300,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3b4c5d6e7f8a90c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Web 安全\n- XSS 攻击与防御\n- CSRF 攻击与防御\n- CSP\n- HTTPS 加密\n- Clickjacking",
      "x": -300,
      "y": 50,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4c5d6e7f8a9b01d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 性能优化\n- 加载性能：资源压缩\n- 代码分割、懒加载\n- 运行时性能\n- 内存泄漏\n- LCP / FID / CLS\n- Core Web Vitals",
      "x": -250,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5d6e7f8a9b0c12e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 测试\n- 单元测试 Jest/Vitest\n- 组件测试 React Testing Library\n- E2E 测试 Cypress\n- Mock 方案\n- CI 集成",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "d6e7f8a9b0c1d23f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 跨端开发\n- 小程序开发\n- React Native\n- Flutter Web\n- Taro\n- Electron",
      "x": 220,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 180,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7f8a9b0c1d2e340",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 进阶领域\n- 数据可视化：ECharts/D3\n- WebGL / Three.js\n- WebRTC\n- WebAssembly\n- PWA\n- Server Components",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f8a9b0c1d2e3f451",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 前端架构\n- 可维护性设计\n- 组件库建设\n- 前端框架原理\n- 状态管理设计\n- 错误监控\n- 日志上报",
      "x": -800,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 200,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
